# Quill's starter tables (YUI-170). A small first deck to try the review queue with; Box goes up as you get a card right.
table create decks Deck:text Subject:text Cards:number Last:date
put decks capitals Deck="World capitals" Subject=Geography Cards=8
table create review Front:text Back:text Deck:text Box:number Due:date
put review c1 Front="Capital of Japan?" Back=Tokyo Deck="World capitals" Box=1
put review c2 Front="Capital of Canada?" Back=Ottawa Deck="World capitals" Box=1
put review c3 Front="Capital of Australia?" Back=Canberra Deck="World capitals" Box=1
put review c4 Front="Capital of Brazil?" Back=Brasilia Deck="World capitals" Box=1
put review c5 Front="Capital of Kenya?" Back=Nairobi Deck="World capitals" Box=1
put review c6 Front="Capital of Turkey?" Back=Ankara Deck="World capitals" Box=1
put review c7 Front="Capital of New Zealand?" Back=Wellington Deck="World capitals" Box=1
put review c8 Front="Capital of Egypt?" Back=Cairo Deck="World capitals" Box=1
